84
00:09:05,290 --> 00:09:06,300
You’re right.

85
00:09:08,190 --> 00:09:10,000
I can’t see the moon tonight.

86
00:09:12,420 --> 00:09:15,200
Sometimes, we need to give something up

87
00:09:17,000 --> 00:09:21,800
to keep something else alive.

88
00:10:43,400 --> 00:10:44,200
(Key.)

89
00:10:45,440 --> 00:10:48,240
(I know you probably don’t want
to talk to me right now.)

90
00:10:50,130 --> 00:10:51,600
