91
00:10:52,480 --> 00:10:53,700
I’m begging you.

92
00:10:54,790 --> 00:10:56,450
(Please listen to the whole message.)

93
00:11:00,280 --> 00:11:01,900
(I have something to tell you.)

94
00:11:04,330 --> 00:11:05,700
