96
00:11:17,830 --> 00:11:20,970
(Right now, I’m looking for you.)

97
00:11:23,710 --> 00:11:25,700
(Even though I don’t know where you are,)

98
00:11:27,510 --> 00:11:32,380
(I think you might be at the place
where we first met.)

99
00:14:22,990 --> 00:14:25,080
(Key, do you want to go
watch the stars with me?)

100
